SUMMARY:Earthshot Innovation Challenge Pitch Competition 
LOCATION:The Pub
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: 
 You are Confirmed\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/1994
 92\n\n5:00PM Reception\, 5:30PM Program\nBefore the spotlight turns to the
  annual Earthshot Innovation Challenge Award Ceremony at the John F. Kenne
 dy Presidential Library this winter\, The 'Quin Impact Fund invites member
 s to an exclusive first look at the next generation of climate innovation.
 \n\nDuring this special preview\, Earthshot Innovation Challenge semi-fina
 lists will present their breakthrough concepts\, sharing bold ideas design
 ed to address some of the world's most pressing environmental challenges. 
 Members will hear each pitch\, engage with the ideas\, and cast their vote
 s in real time to select the solution they wish to propel into the challen
 ge finals\, securing at least $25\,000 in grant funding\, and raising thei
 r chances to be awarded the top prize of $100\,000.\n\nThis exclusive even
 t offers a unique opportunity to experience the innovation process firstha
 nd while helping elevate promising solutions before they take the stage at
  the formal competition. Be among the first to discover the visionary entr
 epreneurs shaping a more sustainable future - and play a role in recognizi
 ng the ideas with the greatest potential to create lasting impact.\n\n*Thi
 s event is complimentary and reserved for members only. Complimentary lig
 ht bites and refreshments will be served. We kindly ask that all cancella
 tions be made at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/199492
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Impact Fund
END:VEVENT
